  "VIEW": "ZOBRAZIŤ",
  "EXECUTED": "VYKONANÉ",
  "FLOW COMPLETED": "WORKFLOW DOKONČENÝ",
  "— all three steps executed successfully.": "— všetky tri kroky boli úspešne vykonané.",
  "FAILED AND COMPENSATED": "ZLYHALO A BOLO KOMPENZOVANÉ",
  "— a step failed; every completed step was compensated by a real on-chain transaction, in reverse order. The final state matches the starting state. The transaction history does not disappear, and it should not: it is the audit trail.": "— krok zlyhal; každý dokončený krok bol kompenzovaný skutočnou transakciou on-chain, v opačnom poradí. Konečný stav zodpovedá východiskovému. História transakcií nezmizne a ani by nemala: je to auditná stopa.",
  "COMPENSATION INCOMPLETE": "KOMPENZÁCIA NEÚPLNÁ",
  "— a compensating transaction did not confirm. Manual intervention is required. This state is surfaced rather than hidden.": "— kompenzačná transakcia nebola potvrdená. Je potrebný manuálny zásah. Tento stav sa zobrazuje, nie skrýva.",
