  "PAY": "ZAPLATIŤ",
  "Generate a payment order in three steps: choose the service and amount, choose how you want to pay, and get the exact payment details with your order number.": "Vytvorte platobný príkaz v troch krokoch: zvoľte službu a sumu, zvoľte spôsob platby a získajte presné platobné údaje s číslom objednávky.",
  "01 — SERVICE & AMOUNT": "01 — SLUŽBA A SUMA",
  "Service": "Služba",
  "Project amount": "Suma projektu",
  "Currency": "Mena",
  "Deposit and milestone percentages are set in your written agreement — use the split that matches your quote.": "Percentá zálohy a míľnikov sú stanovené vo vašej písomnej zmluve — použite rozdelenie, ktoré zodpovedá vašej ponuke.",
  "Customer service (optional)": "Zákaznícky servis (nepovinné)",
  "If one of our customer service staff assisted you, type their name here so we can credit them.": "Ak vám pomohol niekto z nášho zákazníckeho servisu, napíšte sem jeho meno, aby sme mu to mohli pripísať.",
